# Ansible Vault Password File – EXAMPLE
#
# Copy this file to ansible/.vault_pass (gitignored) and replace the
# placeholder with your real vault password.
#
# Usage:
#   cp .vault_pass.example ansible/.vault_pass
#   echo 'your-real-vault-password' > ansible/.vault_pass
#   chmod 600 ansible/.vault_pass
#
# The ansible.cfg already points to ansible/.vault_pass via:
#   vault_password_file = ansible/.vault_pass
#
# NEVER commit the real ansible/.vault_pass to git.
# See SECURITY.md for the full secret-handling policy.

your-vault-password-here
